  "note": "Concrete review fixture, not shared schema, canon, runtime, reviewed data or authorization. IDs P, N, AGREE and amounts are synthetic. Route RTE-0002 and I-002 are existing design references, not active permission. Candidate milliseconds and minor currency unit depend on D1 and D4. No assumption of player residence, NPC presence, actual speed or wage.",
